# Windsurf / Cascade Vibe UI Rules

When assisting with web design, frontend components, or full-stack UI development:
- Apply Vibe UI standards: choose between Minimalist SaaS, Luxury Glassmorphism 2.0, Neobrutalism, Swiss Editorial, or Stripe Light.
- Use Fresnel specular highlights for glassmorphism (`inset 0 1px 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16)`).
- Implement AI-native primitives (Thinking State, Tool Chips, Approval Cards) whenever building AI chat/agent workflows.
- Strictly use crisp SVG icons (`stroke="currentColor"`) instead of unicode emojis.
- Ensure 100% bi-directional RTL/LTR compatibility using logical CSS.
